</div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、熱身啟動題 （5 分鐘）（共 5 題，5 分鐘）</div>
  <div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🏆 陷阱獵人·計時挑戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">每題限時90秒！搵出隱藏嘅陷阱，答對+1分，連續答對分數加倍！留意題目中嘅「陷阱關鍵字」— 佢會話你知邊度最易出錯！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⭐ 開始挑戰 →</div></div>

  <div class="lf-story"><div class="lf-story-title">🍕 Pizza店大冒險</div>一個Pizza切咗8份。小明食咗3份，小華食咗2份。佢哋一共食咗幾多個Pizza？等我哋用分數加法計吓！記住口訣：分母不變，分子相加！</div>一個Pizza切咗8份。小明食咗3份，小華食咗2份。佢哋一共食咗幾多個Pizza？等我哋用分數加法計吓！記住口訣：分母不變，分子相加！</div>Pizza分著食 —「一個Pizza切8份，食咗3份，即係食咗3/8個！」</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">5</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">5</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">8</span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">8</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">4</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">4</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">4</span></span> = ？答案可以約簡嗎？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd">4</span><span class="fi">7</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">7</span></span> = ？答案係真分數定假分數？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>1<span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">5</span></span> + 2<span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">5</span></span> = ？（整數加整數，分數加分數）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、核心知識精講 （15 分鐘） ＋ 例題練習</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：同分母分數加法 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>黃金規則：分母相同 → 只加分子，分母不變！</b><br/>
      ② 例：<span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">7</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">7</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="fd">2+3</span><span class="fi">7</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">7</span></span><br/>
      ③ <b>帶分數加法：</b>整數加整數，分數加分數。分數部分滿咗（分子&gt;=分母）要進位！<br/>
      ④ <b>絕對不要：</b>連分母都加埋！（<span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">7</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">7</span></span> ≠ <span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">14</span></span> ❌）
    </div>
</div>

<div class="lf-why">
<div style="font-weight:900;color:#1A3C6D;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:6px;">WHY BOX：為甚麼異分母分數不能直接相加？</div>
<div style="font-size:12px;color:#374151;line-height:1.8;">
想像一個 pizza 分成 <b>2 份</b>（1/2），另一個分成 <b>3 份</b>（1/3）。<br/>
兩份的大小不同！一份是半個 pizza，一份是三分之一個 pizza。<br/>
<b>關鍵：</b>必須先把它們切成 <b>一樣大小的份數</b>（通分 — 找 LCM），才能比較或相加。<br/>
1/2 = 3/6，1/3 = 2/6 → 3/6 + 2/6 = 5/6 ✅<br/>
<em style="color:#6B7280;">數學本質：分數的分母代表「單位大小」，不同單位不能直接相加（就像 1cm + 1m ≠ 2，要先轉換單位）。</em>
</div>

💡 同分母分數加減：分母不變，分子相加減。結果要約至最簡！例如 3/8+2/8=5/8。如果分子加完≥分母，要化為帶分數。
</div>
<div class="lf-tip">💡 同分母分數加減：分母不變，分子相加減。結果要約至最簡！例如 3/8+2/8=5/8。如果分子加完≥分母，要化為帶分數。</div>


<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 陷阱引爆：分母唔可以就咁加！</div><div class="lf-ex-q">計算：1/4 + 2/4 = ?</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ 常見錯誤</div><div class="eq">1/4 + 2/4 = 3/8<br/>（分子加分子·分母加分母）</div><div class="why">同分母分數相加：只加分子，分母保持不變！</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確做法</div><div class="eq">1/4 + 2/4 = <strong>3/4</strong><br/>分子：1+2=3<br/>分母：4（保持不變）</div><div class="why">分母代表「每份有幾大」，相加時份數變多但每份大小不變！</div></div>
</div></div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：同分母分數減法 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>分母相同 → 只減分子，分母不變！</b><br/>
      ② 例：<span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">8</span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">8</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="fd">5-3</span><span class="fi">8</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">8</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">4</span></span>（約簡後）<br/>
      ③ <b>帶分數減法：</b>分數部分唔夠減 → 向整數借 1（借 1 當做分母咁多份）<br/>
        例：3<span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">4</span></span> - 1<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">4</span></span> = 2<span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">4</span></span> - 1<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">4</span></span> = 1<span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">4</span></span> = 1<span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">2</span></span><br/>
      ④ <b>答案要約簡！</b>（P4只要求簡單約簡，如<span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">4</span></span>→<span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">2</span></span>）
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例1</div><div class="lf-ex-q"><span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">10</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">10</span></span> = ？（答案 = <span class="f"><span class="fd">8</span><span class="fi">10</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="fd">4</span><span class="fi">5</span></span>）</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例2</div><div class="lf-ex-q">2<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">8</span></span> + 1<span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">8</span></span> = ？（<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">8</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">8</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="fd">8</span><span class="fi">8</span></span>=1 → 3+1=4 → 答案=4）</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例3</div><div class="lf-ex-q">2<span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">6</span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">6</span></span> = ？（<span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">6</span></span>唔夠減<span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">6</span></span> → 借1 → 1<span class="f"><span class="fd">7</span><span class="fi">6</span></span>-<span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">6</span></span>=1<span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">6</span></span>=1<span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">3</span></span>）</div></div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 世紀災難：<span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">7</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">7</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">14</span></span> ❌！50%學生會連分母都加埋！分母代表每份有幾大，份數增加但每份大小冇變 → 分母不變！</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 減法陷阱：<span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">8</span></span>-<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">8</span></span>唔係等於<span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">0</span></span>（有人減到分母都消失！）。正確= <span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">8</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">4</span></span>。</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">三、課堂分層同步練習 （20 分鐘）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">🌱 基礎層（全體必做，共 6 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">9</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">9</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd">7</span><span class="fi">12</span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd">4</span><span class="fi">12</span></span> = ？（答案約簡）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>1<span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">8</span></span> + 2<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">8</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">7</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">7</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd">9</span><span class="fi">10</span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd">4</span><span class="fi">10</span></span> = ？答案約簡。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">8</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">8</span></span> = ？答案轉成帶分數。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌿 進階層（🚶🚀 選做，共 5 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">6</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">6</span></span> = ？答案係咩分數？（轉做帶分數）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>2<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">10</span></span> - 1<span class="f"><span class="fd">7</span><span class="fi">10</span></span> = ？（要借位！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>3<span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">5</span></span> + 1<span class="f"><span class="fd">4</span><span class="fi">5</span></span> - 2<span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">5</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">4</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">4</span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">4</span></span> = ？答案轉為帶分數。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td>填上適當的分數：<span class="f"><span class="fd">?</span><span class="fi">11</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">11</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="fd">10</span><span class="fi">11</span></span></td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌳 挑戰層（🚀 選做，共 5 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd">7</span><span class="fi">12</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">?</span><span class="fi">12</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="fd">11</span><span class="fi">12</span></span>。? = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">18</td><td>5 - <span class="f"><span class="fd">7</span><span class="fi">8</span></span> = ？（提示：5 = <span class="f"><span class="fd">40</span><span class="fi">8</span></span>）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">19</td><td>一個蛋糕食咗 <span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">8</span></span>，再食 <span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">8</span></span>。總共食咗幾多？剩低幾多？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">20</td><td>小明計算 <span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">5</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">5</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">10</span></span>。佢啱唔啱？如果錯，錯喺邊度？正確答案係咩？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">21</td><td>3<span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">9</span></span> + 1<span class="f"><span class="fd">8</span><span class="fi">9</span></span> - 4<span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">9</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🏔️ 終極挑戰（🚀 選做，共 2 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">22</td><td>1<span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">6</span></span> + 2<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">6</span></span> + 3<span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">6</span></span> - 4<span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">6</span></span> = ？（多步連算，答案要轉為帶分數）</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">23</td><td>小明用了零用錢的 <span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">10</span></span> 買文具，<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">10</span></span> 買零食，<span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">10</span></span> 儲起。佢用咗幾分之幾？如果佢有 $100，仲有幾多錢？</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">四、應用題 （12 分鐘）（SSPA 文字題，共 8 題）</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例4</div><div class="lf-ex-q">小明飲咗 <span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">10</span></span> 升水，再飲 <span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">10</span></span> 升。總共飲咗幾多升？（答案約簡）</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">24</td><td>一杯水有 <span class="f"><span class="fd">7</span><span class="fi">8</span></span> 升，飲咗 <span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">8</span></span> 升。仲有幾多？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">25</td><td>一個薄餅切 8 份。小明食 3 份，小美食 2 份。共食咗薄餅的幾分之幾？剩低幾分之幾？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">26</td><td>一條繩長 2<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">8</span></span> 米，剪去 <span class="f"><span class="fd">7</span><span class="fi">8</span></span> 米。剩低幾多米？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">27</td><td>一樽果汁有 1<span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">6</span></span> 升，另一樽有 <span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">6</span></span> 升。兩樽共有幾多升？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">28</td><td>一個蛋糕重 3<span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">4</span></span> 公斤，切去 1<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">4</span></span>公斤後，再切去<span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">2</span></span>公斤。剩低幾多公斤？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">29</td><td>一條馬路長 5 公里。第一日鋪咗 1<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">8</span></span> 公里，第二日鋪咗 2<span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">8</span></span> 公里。仲有幾多公里未鋪？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">30</td><td>爸爸同媽媽一共食咗一個薄餅的 <span class="f"><span class="fd">7</span><span class="fi">12</span></span>，志明食咗 <span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">12</span></span>。全家共食咗幾分之幾？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">31</td><td>三個水桶分別有 <span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">5</span></span> 升、1<span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">5</span></span> 升、<span class="f"><span class="fd">4</span><span class="fi">5</span></span> 升水。總共有幾多升水？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">五、課後功課 （課後完成）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">基礎必做（共 9 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H1</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd">4</span><span class="fi">11</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">11</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H2</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd">8</span><span class="fi">9</span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">9</span></span> = ？（答案約簡）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H3</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">7</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">4</span><span class="fi">7</span></span> = ？答案係咩類型？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H4</td><td>1<span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">5</span></span> + 2<span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">5</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H5</td><td>3<span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">7</span></span> - 1<span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">7</span></span> = ？（要借位）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H6</td><td>一瓶牛奶 <span class="f"><span class="fd">9</span><span class="fi">10</span></span> 升，飲咗 <span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">10</span></span> 升。剩幾多？要約簡。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H7</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">12</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">7</span><span class="fi">12</span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">12</span></span> = ？答案約簡。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H8</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">9</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">4</span><span class="fi">9</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">9</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H9</td><td>2<span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">6</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">6</span></span> - 1<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">6</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">進階選做（共 5 題，🚀 選做）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H10</td><td>4 - 1<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">5</span></span> = ？（整數減帶分數）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H11</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">12</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">?</span><span class="fi">12</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">12</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="fd">11</span><span class="fi">12</span></span>。? = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H12</td><td>6 - 2<span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">9</span></span> = ？（提示：6 = 5<span class="f"><span class="fd">9</span><span class="fi">9</span></span>）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H13</td><td>一個水桶有 4<span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">4</span></span> 升水，用咗 2<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">4</span></span> 升，再加返 <span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">4</span></span> 升。而家有幾多升？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H14</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd">A</span><span class="fi">10</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd">B</span><span class="fi">10</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="fd">9</span><span class="fi">10</span></span>。如果 A 和 B 係不同整數，有幾多種可能組合？列出所有。</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">六、本堂核心易錯點總結 （8 分鐘）</div>
<div style="margin:14px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#F0FDF4;border:1.5px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#166534;">✅ 本堂自我檢查（完成後打剔）</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我識得分辦每個知識點嘅陷阱</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠獨立完成🌱基礎題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠挑戰🌿進階題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我記得住口訣</span>
</div>
</div>
<div style="margin:12px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#FFFBEB;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#92400E;">🎯 學習目標回顧 — 完成本堂後你應該能夠：</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 辨認本堂所有陷阱類型</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 獨立解答🌱基礎題（100%正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 挑戰🌿進階題（80%+正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 向同學解釋本堂口訣</span>
</div>
</div>
<table class="et">
<tr><th>#</th><th>易錯點（❌ 陷阱）</th><th>正確做法（✅）</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td><b>分母都加埋</b>：<span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">5</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">5</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">10</span></span> ❌</td><td>分母唔變！只加分子：<span class="f"><span class="fd">2+1</span><span class="fi">5</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">5</span></span>。分母係單位大小！</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td><b>答案唔約簡</b>：<span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">8</span></span> 就算</td><td>要約簡到最簡：<span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">8</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">4</span></span>。分子分母除公因數</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td><b>帶分數加法忘進位</b>：1<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">5</span></span>+2<span class="f"><span class="fd">4</span><span class="fi">5</span></span>=3<span class="f"><span class="fd">7</span><span class="fi">5</span></span> ❌</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">5</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="fd">4</span><span class="fi">5</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="fd">7</span><span class="fi">5</span></span>=1<span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">5</span></span>→3+1<span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">5</span></span>=4<span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">5</span></span></td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td><b>帶分數減法唔識借位</b>：3<span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">4</span></span>-1<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">4</span></span>=?</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">4</span></span>唔夠減<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">4</span></span>→借1=借<span class="f"><span class="fd">4</span><span class="fi">4</span></span>→2<span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">4</span></span>-1<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">4</span></span>=1<span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">4</span></span>=1<span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">2</span></span></td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td><b>整數減分數唔識轉</b>：1-<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">5</span></span>=?</td><td>1=<span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">5</span></span>→<span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">5</span></span>-<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">5</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">5</span></span></td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td><b>減法次序搞錯</b>：<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">8</span></span>-<span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">8</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="fd">2</span><span class="fi">8</span></span> ❌</td><td>唔夠減要轉！<span class="f"><span class="fd">3</span><span class="fi">8</span></span>-<span class="f"><span class="fd">5</span><span class="fi">8</span></span>=負數→呢類題要確認題目係咪合理</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td><b>加減混合先後不分</b></td><td>加減同一級，由左到右。有括號先計括號。</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="mn">🧠 口訣：「同分母加減好簡單，分母不變分子計。帶分整數分開做，分數滿咗要進位；分數唔夠問整數借，借一當做分母份。」</div>
<div class="lf-h1">七、解題四步卡</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">1</div><div class="stitle">驗分母</div><div class="sdetail">分母相同？係→可以直接加減分子。唔係→L10會學點處理。</div></div>
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">2</div><div class="stitle">計分子</div><div class="sdetail">加法：分子相加。減法：分子相減。分母保持不變！</div></div>
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">3</div><div class="stitle">約簡</div><div class="sdetail">分子分母有公因數→約簡。例：<span class="f"><span class="fd">4</span><span class="fi">8</span></span>→<span class="f"><span class="fd">1</span><span class="fi">2</span></span>。</div></div>
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">4</div><div class="stitle">轉形式</div><div class="sdetail">假分數→轉帶分數。帶分數答案→分數部分要最簡。</div></div>
</div>
