<div class="lf-h1"><span class="h1-icon">✅</span> 答案參考（做完先睇！）</div>
<div class="lf-parent-summary"><div class="lf-ps-title">📝 答案快查</div>
<table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th>答案</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td style="font-size:11px">15 + 25 = ？</td><td style="font-weight:900;color:var(--gold);padding:5px 10px;font-size:12px">問老師</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td style="font-size:11px">58 - 38 = ？</td><td style="font-weight:900;color:var(--gold);padding:5px 10px;font-size:12px">問老師</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td style="font-size:11px">14 + 14 + 14 = ？答案可以約簡嗎？</td><td style="font-weight:900;color:var(--gold);padding:5px 10px;font-size:12px">問老師</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td style="font-size:11px">47 + 57 = ？答案係真分數定假分數？</td><td style="font-weight:900;color:var(--gold);padding:5px 10px;font-size:12px">問老師</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td style="font-size:11px">125 + 215 = ？（整數加整數，分數加分數）</td><td style="font-weight:900;color:var(--gold);padding:5px 10px;font-size:12px">問老師</td></tr>
</table>
<div style="font-size:9px;color:var(--gray-400);text-align:center;margin-top:4px">⚠️ 請先自己完成練習，再查答案！🟢=自動計算 🟡=請向老師確認</div>
</div>

